        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Site for Sale Subject to Planning Permission\r\nLackandarra, Colligan, Dungarvan, Co. Waterford\r\nFolio No. WD29852F | Approx. 0.375 Hectares / 0.93 Acres\r\nDenise Radley Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale this attractive 0.375 hectare (approximately 0.93 acre) site, being sold subject to planning permission.\r\nThe site forms part of Folio WD29852F and is situated at Lackendarra, Colligan, in a particularly picturesque and peaceful part of Co. Waterford.\r\nLackendarra enjoys an excellent rural location just off the main Clonmel–Dungarvan Road, approximately 15 minutes from Dungarvan and 25 minutes from Clonmel, making it an ideal location for those seeking countryside living while remaining within convenient reach of both towns.\r\nOne of the great attractions of the location is its proximity to the beautiful Colligan Woods, offering wonderful woodland walks and outdoor recreation practically on the doorstep. The surrounding countryside is exceptionally scenic and provides an attractive setting for a future family home, subject to obtaining the necessary planning permission.\r\nThe area is also known for its strong community spirit and is well served by local amenities. There is a good primary school nearby, while a choice of secondary schools is available in both Dungarvan and Clonmel.\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity for anyone hoping to build their own home in a scenic countryside location with convenient access to Dungarvan and Clonmel.\r\nFeatures:\r\nSite extending to approx. 0.375 hectares / 0.93 acres \r\nBeing sold subject to planning permission \r\nPart of Folio WD29852F \r\nAttractive countryside setting \r\nClose to Colligan Woods \r\nApprox. 15 minutes from Dungarvan \r\nApprox. 25 minutes from Clonmel \r\nConvenient to the main Clonmel–Dungarvan Road \r\nPrimary school nearby \r\nSecondary schools available in Dungarvan and Clonmel \r\nStrong local community \r\nFurther details available from Denise Radley Auctioneers."
      }
